#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:7
msgid "Inertial Measurement Unit (IMU)"
msgstr "惯性测量单元 (IMU)"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:9
msgid ""
"A :class:`~sensors.Imu` models the two quantities produced by a conventional"
" inertial measurement unit:"
msgstr ":class:`~sensors.Imu` 模拟传统惯性测量单元输出的两种量："

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:12
msgid ""
":attr:`~sensors.ImuData.ang_vel_b`: angular velocity [rad/s] relative to the"
" world, expressed in the IMU frame."
msgstr ":attr:`~sensors.ImuData.ang_vel_b` ：相对于世界的角速度 [rad/s]，以 IMU 坐标系表示。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:14
msgid ""
":attr:`~sensors.ImuData.lin_acc_b`: proper linear acceleration [m/s²], "
"expressed in the IMU frame."
msgstr ":attr:`~sensors.ImuData.lin_acc_b` ：固有线加速度 [m/s²]，以 IMU 坐标系表示。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:16
msgid ""
"Proper acceleration is what an accelerometer measures. It is zero in free "
"fall and points upward with magnitude :math:`g` for a stationary sensor "
"supported against gravity. This differs from the coordinate acceleration "
"reported by the :doc:`pva`."
msgstr ""
"固有加速度是加速度计实际测量的量。自由落体时它为零；传感器静止、受到支撑而抵抗重力时，它指向上方，大小为 :math:`g` 。这与 "
":doc:`pva` 报告的坐标加速度不同。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:20
msgid "Forces that determine proper acceleration for an IMU"
msgstr "决定 IMU 固有加速度的力"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:26
msgid "Configure the sensor"
msgstr "配置传感器"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:28
msgid ""
"Attach the sensor to a rigid body or to a fixed child frame beneath one. "
"``offset`` places and orients the measurement frame relative to the parent "
"frame."
msgstr "将传感器附着到刚体，或刚体下方的固定子坐标系。 ``offset`` 设置测量坐标系相对于父坐标系的位置和方向。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:45
msgid ""
"Both data fields are :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` buffers. For "
"``E`` environments, their Torch views have shape ``(E, 3)``:"
msgstr ""
"这两个数据字段都是 :class:`~isaaclab.utils.warp.ProxyArray` 缓冲区。对于 ``E`` 个环境，其 Torch "
"视图形状为 ``(E, 3)`` ："

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:54
msgid ""
"The acceleration estimate depends on consecutive simulation states. Reset "
"the scene and its sensors together so derivative history is not carried "
"across episodes. Use a sensor update period compatible with the control loop"
" that consumes the measurement."
msgstr "加速度估计依赖连续的仿真状态。请同时重置场景及其传感器，避免将求导历史带入下一回合。传感器更新周期应与使用该测量值的控制循环兼容。"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:58
msgid "IMU acceleration debug visualization"
msgstr "IMU 加速度调试可视化"

#: source/concepts/sensors/imu.rst:63
msgid "A complete runnable example is available as ``imu``:"
msgstr "完整的可运行示例名为 ``imu`` ："
